              "text": "They were too fast and could easily hide from him.",
              "audioStart": 94.812,
              "audioEnd": 97.375
            },
            {
              "text": "Because the man could not reach them, he felt very upset and decided to ask for help.",
              "audioStart": 98.237,
              "audioEnd": 102.725
            },
            {
              "text": "He walked along the river bank and looked everywhere for the animals.",
              "audioStart": 103.588,
              "audioEnd": 106.838
            },
            {
              "text": "His mind was set on capturing them before the afternoon sun reached the sky.",
              "audioStart": 107.7,
              "audioEnd": 111.75
            },
            {
              "text": "However, the little animals were much faster than he expected them to be.",
              "audioStart": 112.612,
              "audioEnd": 116.45
            },
            {
              "text": "They ran into the deep green plants where the man could not follow them at all.",
              "audioStart": 117.312,
              "audioEnd": 120.888
            },
            {
              "text": "The man tried to catch them again.",
              "audioStart": 121.75,
              "audioEnd": 123.55
            },
            {
              "text": "He failed completely every single time.",
              "audioStart": 124.412,
              "audioEnd": 126.688
            },
            {
              "text": "He stood by the water and thought about what he should do next.",
              "audioStart": 127.55,
              "audioEnd": 130.425
            },
            {
              "text": "His big plan was not working.",
              "audioStart": 131.287,
              "audioEnd": 132.988
            },
            {
              "text": "Time was running out very quickly.",
              "audioStart": 133.85,
              "audioEnd": 135.637
            },
            {
              "text": "The man looked around the river bank with great frustration.",
              "audioStart": 136.5,
              "audioEnd": 139.412
            },
            {
              "text": "He wanted to take the small creatures back to his home.",
              "audioStart": 140.275,
              "audioEnd": 142.9
            },
            {
              "text": "He spent hours searching every part of the tall grass.",
              "audioStart": 143.762,
              "audioEnd": 146.537
            },
            {
              "text": "His efforts produced no results.",
              "audioStart": 147.4,
              "audioEnd": 149.325
            },
            {
              "text": "The clever animals always stayed one step ahead of him.",
              "audioStart": 150.188,
              "audioEnd": 153
            },
            {
              "text": "The man sat down by a large tree to rest his feet.",
              "audioStart": 153.863,
              "audioEnd": 156.85
            },
            {
              "text": "He wondered how they could move so fast.",
              "audioStart": 157.713,
              "audioEnd": 159.775
            },
            {
              "text": "He tried to think of a new way to catch them.",
              "audioStart": 160.637,
              "audioEnd": 162.8
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing came to his mind.",
              "audioStart": 163.662,
              "audioEnd": 165.062
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun began to move across the sky.",
              "audioStart": 165.925,
              "audioEnd": 167.963
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that he must act soon if he wanted to succeed.",
              "audioStart": 168.825,
              "audioEnd": 171.613
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Soon, a wise mother appeared and looked at the situation with great care.",
              "audioStart": 172.475,
              "audioEnd": 176.3
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that the little animals needed protection if they were going to survive in the wild.",
              "audioStart": 177.162,
              "audioEnd": 181.35
            },
            {
              "text": "Therefore, she used her magic to change their skin into something much harder and stronger.",
              "audioStart": 182.213,
              "audioEnd": 187.088
            },
            {
              "text": "The wise mother spoke softly to the little creatures so they would not feel afraid.",
              "audioStart": 187.95,
              "audioEnd": 191.9
            },
            {
              "text": "She told them that everything would be alright and that they should stay calm.",
              "audioStart": 192.762,
              "audioEnd": 196.137
            },
            {
              "text": "With a wave of her hand, the magic began to work upon their bodies.",
              "audioStart": 197,
              "audioEnd": 200.6
            },
            {
              "text": "The soft skin slowly became a hard shell.",
              "audioStart": 201.463,
              "audioEnd": 203.812
            },
            {
              "text": "This hard shell could cover their whole body completely.",
              "audioStart": 204.675,
              "audioEnd": 207.375
            },
            {
              "text": "If the man tried to touch them again, he would only find a tough stone-like surface instead of soft animal skin.",
              "audioStart": 208.238,
              "audioEnd": 214.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Thus, they were completely safe from any danger that might come near them.",
              "audioStart": 214.988,
              "audioEnd": 218.812
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother smiled as she watched the amazing change take place right before her eyes.",
              "audioStart": 219.675,
              "audioEnd": 224.162
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that her magic would protect them from any future trouble.",
              "audioStart": 225.025,
              "audioEnd": 228.338
            },
            {
              "text": "The little creatures looked at their new bodies with great surprise.",
              "audioStart": 229.2,
              "audioEnd": 232.425
            },
            {
              "text": "They felt different, but they also felt very strong.",
              "audioStart": 233.287,
              "audioEnd": 236.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The wise mother told them that they no longer needed to fear the man.",
              "audioStart": 236.988,
              "audioEnd": 240.25
            },
            {
              "text": "She advised them to use their new power wisely.",
              "audioStart": 241.113,
              "audioEnd": 243.575
            },
            {
              "text": "They thanked the mother for her great help.",
              "audioStart": 244.438,
              "audioEnd": 246.338
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother nodded and smiled gently before she left the area.",
              "audioStart": 247.2,
              "audioEnd": 250.325
            },
            {
              "text": "The creatures felt ready to face whatever might happen next.",
              "audioStart": 251.188,
              "audioEnd": 254.262
            },
            {
              "text": "Their lives had changed forever.",
              "audioStart": 255.125,
              "audioEnd": 256.837
            },
            {
              "text": "They tested their new shells by moving around the soft ground.",
              "audioStart": 257.7,
              "audioEnd": 260.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything felt secure.",
              "audioStart": 261.562,
              "audioEnd": 262.9
            },
            {
              "text": "The magic had worked perfectly.",
              "audioStart": 263.762,
              "audioEnd": 266.759
            },
            {
              "text": "They were safe.",
              "audioStart": 267.621,
              "audioEnd": 268.558
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "From that day forward, the animals became the first tiny shell-bearing creatures of the world.",
              "audioStart": 269.421,
              "audioEnd": 274.084
            },
            {
              "text": "They could walk slowly across the land or roll into a ball whenever they felt afraid.",
              "audioStart": 274.946,
              "audioEnd": 279.071
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the forest was happy because the little creatures finally had a wonderful home and protection.",
              "audioStart": 279.933,
              "audioEnd": 285.021
            },
            {
              "text": "The man tried to touch them once more.",
              "audioStart": 285.884,
              "audioEnd": 287.846
            },
            {
              "text": "His hands only found the hard shell.",
              "audioStart": 288.709,
              "audioEnd": 290.646
            },
            {
              "text": "He realized that he could no longer hurt them.",
              "audioStart": 291.509,
              "audioEnd": 293.834
            },
            {
              "text": "So, he walked away from the river.",
              "audioStart": 294.696,
              "audioEnd": 296.709
            },
            {
              "text": "The little creatures celebrated their new life with great joy and dancing.",
              "audioStart": 297.571,
              "audioEnd": 301.209
            },
            {
              "text": "They rolled into balls whenever they heard a loud noise or felt the wind blow too hard.",
              "audioStart": 302.071,
              "audioEnd": 306.271
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing in the forest could break their new protection, no matter how strong it was.",
              "audioStart": 307.134,
              "audioEnd": 311.459
            },
            {
              "text": "Generations passed by, and the animals continued to live in safety.",
              "audioStart": 312.321,
              "audioEnd": 316.221
            },
            {
              "text": "Their story became a famous ancient tale among all the creatures who lived in the green woods.",
              "audioStart": 317.084,
              "audioEnd": 321.571
            },
            {
              "text": "The man never returned to bother them again.",
              "audioStart": 322.433,
              "audioEnd": 324.621
            },
            {
              "text": "He found other things to do with his time.",
              "audioStart": 325.483,
              "audioEnd": 327.521
            },
            {
              "text": "The little creatures grew and multiplied in peace.",
              "audioStart": 328.384,
              "audioEnd": 330.996
            },
            {
              "text": "Their children learned how to roll into balls and protect themselves.",
              "audioStart": 331.858,
              "audioEnd": 335.221
            },
            {
              "text": "The forest remained a peaceful place for all living things.",
              "audioStart": 336.084,
              "audioEnd": 339.159
            },
            {
              "text": "Water flowed smoothly down the river every single day.",
              "audioStart": 340.021,
              "audioEnd": 342.884
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun continued to shine upon the green trees.",
              "audioStart": 343.746,
              "audioEnd": 346.358
            },
            {
              "text": "Friendship and safety ruled the woods.",
              "audioStart": 347.221,
              "audioEnd": 349.146
            },
            {
              "text": "No danger could ever break their hard shells.",
              "audioStart": 350.009,
              "audioEnd": 352.384
            },
            {
              "text": "They lived happily through every season of the year.",
              "audioStart": 353.246,
              "audioEnd": 355.571
            },
            {
              "text": "The ancient tale was told to every new generation.",
              "audioStart": 356.433,
              "audioEnd": 358.933
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone remembered the wise mother and her great magic.",
              "audioStart": 359.796,
              "audioEnd": 362.709
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
